Assimilation, tips, and related subjects— it encompasses all of that and returns the result as if it were an AI model operating within the query itself.

There are things that can be integrated with AI and others that can't.

You can't create a brain with code; the brain isn't a physical thing.

Just as the brain has already reached its limit, human sharing has already reached its limit, and AI will reach its limit at some point.

